<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Media in Canto</span><p>Find an existing explanation of a topic or technology.</p></div><a href="https://skao.canto.global/v/SKAOLibrary?from_main_library" class="button">Open the Canto library ↗</a></div><div class="media-handoff"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><div><h2>Search in the source library</h2><p>Search by subject and check whether the science and technical depiction remain current.</p><p class="quiet-note">This opens the general staff library. A verified collection-specific link is not yet available here.</p></div></div><section class="reading-section"><h2>Before using an asset</h2><ul><li>Read the credit, copyright and usage information on the asset.</li><li>Check that it suits your intended audience and use. Availability alone is not permission for every use.</li><li>Choose an appropriate download format; keep the credit with your working file.</li></ul></section><aside class="next-step"><div><h2>Can’t find or access the material?</h2><p>Include your search terms, intended use and the link or error shown.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Canto DAM Access')" class="text-link">Get help with Canto</a></aside>
