<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Plan, review, hand over</span><p>Work back from the use date with the event organiser and supplier. Confirm the actual deadlines rather than relying on a generic countdown.</p></div></div><section class="reading-section"><h2>1. Define</h2><ul><li>Audience, purpose, venue and outputs.</li><li>Existing resources or event kit that can be reused.</li><li>Content owner, organiser, supplier and final reviewer.</li></ul></section><section class="reading-section"><h2>2. Prepare</h2><ul><li>Supplier templates, dimensions, formats and artwork deadline.</li><li>Draft content, source images and required credits.</li><li>Budget and the applicable approvals.</li></ul></section><section class="reading-section"><h2>3. Review and hand over</h2><ul><li>Content and artwork proof reviewed by the agreed people.</li><li>Supplier-ready file checked against the specification.</li><li>Delivery and on-site arrangements confirmed by the event organiser.</li></ul></section><aside class="next-step"><div><h2>Ready to brief the work?</h2><p>Include the dependencies and anything still missing.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Submitting a Request')" class="text-link">Prepare a creative brief</a></aside>
