#elseif($page.id.toString() == "381891646")
<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Plan the work</span><p>Start with the purpose and audience. Check existing stock before commissioning new items.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Submitting a Request')" class="button">Prepare the creative brief</a></div><section class="reading-section"><h2>Include in the brief</h2><ul><li>Why the item is useful for the audience.</li><li>Available stock or an existing design that could be reused.</li><li>Quantity, budget, destination and use date.</li><li>Supplier requirements, material choices and the artwork reviewer.</li></ul></section><aside class="next-step"><div><h2>Agree before producing</h2><p>The team confirms scope and capacity; supplier timing, cost and approval are agreed for the actual job.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Turnaround Times')" class="text-link">How timing is agreed</a></aside>
